<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:180px">With the stopcock closed, all white H₂ molecules are trapped in the left bulb and all red O₂ molecules fill the right bulb — two pure gases, no exchange possible.</p>
